  "memory": "Contributor signs off on excerpt, context and placement; Mara records, doesn't approve. Any change needs fresh sign-off. Agrees no voice for all twelve and Jonas's pause switch. Still waiting on Theo: contributor payment/review time in estimate, listening event offered to each."
